Dear Sir or Madam

Thanks for providing the methylKit R package. I think it is one of the most useful program for methylation study.

I would like to ask whether the program has another annotate function.

I know there is annotation function "getAssociationWithTss()"

However, I would like get my DMR data with annotation of region(promoter, exon,intron,intergenic..etc) line by line.

(ex)

   id          chr        start           end strand coverage numCs numTs region

1 chr21.17806094.17808094.NA <http://chr21.17806094.17808094.na/> chr21 17806094 17808094 + 1834 7 1827 promoter

2.chr21.10119796.10121796.NA <http://2.chr21.10119796.10121796.na/> chr21 10119796 10121796 - 79 44 35 intron

3.

Please let me know any solution or comment about this.

I look forward to hearing from you.

Regards,

Jongbum Kim.

