I can't see a problem here either. I checked the examples in the package with min.per.group argument and it seems to work. You can try to update the data.table package and try to send a reproducible example with the subset of the data and the code. If you check previous posts or google groups page you will find a link to the description of a reproducible example.

And, as Kalyan pointed out some samples have extremely low coverage and they shouldn't be used if the coverages we see is a representative sample for all CpGs in those samples.
Best,
Altuna

